# Router Abstraction

## BaseRouter Contract
Every router MUST implement:
- `route(question: str, *, tolerance: float) -> RoutingResult`
- `load(checkpoint_path: str | Path) -> None`
- `unload() -> None` (optional, has default no-op)

## RoutingResult
Always return a full RoutingResult with:
- model_names: list of all models scored
- confidences: P(correct) per model
- costs: CostEstimate per model
- selected_model: the chosen model name
- metadata: dict with method-specific info

## Never bypass the abstraction
- Don't call KMeansRouter or PrefillRouter directly in server/CLI code
- Always go through config.build_router_from_config() or ModelRoutingStrategy.from_config()
- The config determines which router runs, never hardcode it
